    <string name="guide_welcome_title">Welcome</string>
    <string name="guide_welcome_body">Read your e-books and comics: from a folder on this device or from your own Nextcloud.\n\nThis short guide shows how it works. You can open it again later in the settings.</string>
    <string name="guide_library_title">Set up your library</string>
    <string name="guide_library_body">Under "Accounts" → "Add account" you have two options:\n\n• Folder on this device: pick a folder with e-books (sub-folders and SD card too). The app reads it, no server needed.\n\n• Nextcloud account: sign in through the browser. Your server needs the "E-Book Reader" app.\n\nYou can add as many folders and accounts as you like.</string>
    <string name="guide_browse_title">Find books</string>
    <string name="guide_browse_body">• Search, filter and sort at the top of the library.\n\n• Tabs for books, series and folders (and shelves with Nextcloud).\n\n• Tap a book for details, rating and reading status.\n\n• Pull down to read folders again and sync accounts.</string>
    <string name="guide_read_title">Read</string>
    <string name="guide_read_body">• Tap or swipe left/right to turn the page.\n\n• Tap the middle or swipe up for the menu with the progress slider.\n\n• Swipe down to close the book; your position is saved.\n\n• Long press text to highlight it or add a note.</string>
    <string name="guide_move_title">Offline, copy and move</string>
    <string name="guide_move_body">• Make Nextcloud books available offline in their details.\n\n• Book details → ⋮: copy or move a book to another account, e.g. from a folder on your phone to your Nextcloud.\n\n• Reading progress and highlights come along.</string>
